## Definition of Done

- [ ] With `AI_PROVIDER_*` set: chat gets real LLM reply, epics are LLM-derived
- [ ] Without `AI_PROVIDER_*`: mock reply works (existing behavior)
- [ ] Typing indicator visible during LLM generation
- [ ] Context window managed (no infinite token growth)
- [ ] `bun run test` green

